Elliptic flow, \(v_{2}=\langle\cos 2(\phi_{i}-\Psi)\rangle\), is the second harmonic in the Fourier expansion of the azimuthal distribution relative to the reaction plane. If the observed \(v_{2}>0\), then it is in

